editor_description = "A conifer forest on the new map (Scenes/Map.tscn): the Tundra's taiga, the Volcanic Mountains', the Evergreen Temperate Rainforest's, and every kingdom's high forest above its broadleaf. A Forest, so the party may be set upon in it, at Forest.tscn's odds; this scene sets only its colour, a cool blue-green, see-through over the land."
